=== PHASE 3b - APPLY THE PREREGISTERED SELECTION RULE (no P&L has been computed yet)
======================================================================================================================
   RULE (spec_holdtime.yaml, written before any result): T = the smallest 5-minute-rounded
   tau at which E[forward points | still open at tau] for SHORTS is <= 0 AND STAYS <= 0
   for every remaining tau on the grid. If no such tau exists the rule returns NO
   CANDIDATE and this wave has no exit to test - which is a result, not a failure to
   report.

   SHORT: the rule selects  T = None  -> NO CANDIDATE
   LONG : the same rule would select T_long = None  -> no candidate on the long side either
   split date (median short trade) = 2024-02-29
   FIRST HALF ONLY (1115 short trades): the rule selects T_half = None  -> NO CANDIDATE on the first half

   -> T_FROZEN.json written. Stage 3 may now compute P&L and may not change T.
   [9s]
